t were to follow the demonstration."] "\n\n" [:p {} "The US team played the Olympic demonstration as part of a tour of Australia running from 25 November to 18 December. They had played two games against a New South Wales side prior to the Olympics, and played another 10 after the Games. Some games were played against an Australian team, while others were against New South Wales, Queensland, Victoria, South Australia and Western Australia teams. In all, the American team only lost one game, that to Australia on 5 December, 2-1."] "\n\n" [:p {} "This game has frustrated us somewhat as Olympic historians. Although we know some scoring details, no box score for the game has ever been found despite major efforts to locate one, so we are uncertain as to the details of who played in the game."] "\n"] [:button {:id "button100990", :class "btn btn-default"} "Details"] [:script {} "$('#button100990').click(splits)"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {}] [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Team"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {:class "accordion-toggle", :data-toggle "collapse", :data-target ".team-members-9000760"} [:div {:class "glyphicon glyphicon-plus"}]] [:td {} "1"] [:td {} "United States"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA.png"}] "USA"]] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class " accordion-body team-members-9000760 collapse", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {} "Starting Pitcher"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/902418"} "Vane Sutton"] " "] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class " accordion-body team-members-9000760 collapse", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {} "Relief Pitcher"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/902337"} "Joe Belak"] " "] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class " accordion-body team-members-9000760 collapse", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {} "Relief Pitcher"] 